  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>哥德 RPG 字型</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">說明</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">這款易於閱讀的哥德與中世紀風格字型，將進一步提升您的原版遊戲體驗。最初專為&nbsp;<a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 整合包設計，現已開放給所有玩家使用！<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">本字型基於 <a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffontmeme.com%252ffonts%252fvinque-font%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vinque</a> 字型（由 Typodermic Fonts 製作）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">本字型採用自由字型授權發布。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/585/636/vinque-font-character-map.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1150\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>截圖（來自 DarkRPG）</strong></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/558/457/2022-12-19_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/558/458/2022-12-18_23.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">今天立即申請伺服器，與好友一同遊玩！點擊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 或下方橫幅，並使用優惠碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 即可享有 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:symbol;font-size:24px\">黑暗即將降臨...</span></p>",
